create_particles    O n 0 twopass
Created 9000 particles
  CPU time = 0.00298405 secs

compute temp thermal/grid all all temp
compute trot grid all all trot

compute tvib_O2 tvib/grid all O2

compute red_temp reduce ave c_temp[*]
compute red_trot reduce ave c_trot[*]

compute red_tvib_O2 reduce ave c_tvib_O2[*]

compute	nrho_O2 grid all O2 nrho
compute	nrho_O grid all O nrho

